# a skill directory with no permission bits
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: scanning skills directory "<WORLD>/skills": ondisk: walk <WORLD>/skills: open <WORLD>/skills/alpha: permission denied

# the root itself with none
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 1
